# 8. DC log kontrolü

**Makine: DC01**

Kerberoasting genelde Event ID **4769** üretir.

```powershell
Get-WinEvent -FilterHashtable @{LogName='Security'; Id=4769; StartTime=(Get-Date).AddMinutes(-60)} |
Select-Object TimeCreated, Id, Message
```

Sadece svc_sql için filtre:

```powershell
Get-WinEvent -FilterHashtable @{LogName='Security'; Id=4769; StartTime=(Get-Date).AddMinutes(-60)} |
Where-Object {$_.Message -match "svc_sql"} |
Select-Object TimeCreated, Id, Message
```

Araman gereken alanlar:

```text
Account Name: user_low
Service Name: MSSQLSvc/client02.lab.local:1433
Client Address: Kali IP
Ticket Encryption Type: 0x17
```

`0x17` RC4-HMAC anlamına gelir ve Kerberoasting açısından yüksek sinyaldir.

